<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『この　たたかいで
みえたことが　あるよ……▼
だけど　それは　ほんの　いちぶ▼
つよいとは　どういうことか……
ポケモンとは　なにか……▽
わからない　ことだらけだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:42:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:54:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『この　たたかいで
みえたことが　あるよ……▼
だけど　それは　ほんの一部▼
強いとは　どういうことか……
ポケモンとは　なにか……▽
わからない　ことだらけだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:42:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:54:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:36:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:03" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ホミカ『ゆうしょう　おめでと！
まっ　くやしーけど▼
それにしても　あんた　おもしろい
ポケモントレーナー　だよね！▼
だってそうじゃん！　あんたと
いっしょに　たたかう　ポケモン▽
かつ！　って　いきおい　あるもん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:30:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ホミカ『優勝　おめでと！▼
まっ　くやしーけど▼
それにしても　あんた　おもしろい
ポケモントレーナー　だよね！▼
だってそうじゃん！　あんたと
一緒に　戦う　ポケモン▽
勝つ！　って　勢い　あるもん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:30:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:36:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER2
ホミカ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アーティ『あー　そーだねー
むしポケモンは　いいよね▼
かっても　まけても
あいかわらず　うつくしいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:24:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アーティ『あー　そーだねー
むしポケモンは　いいよね▼
勝っても　負けても
あいかわらず　美しいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:25:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER3
アーティ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カミツレ『ポケモンたちの
がんばりに　こたえるため　そして▼
はなやかな　スポットを
あびて　もらいたくて……！▼
そういう　いみで　あなたの　ポケモン
まぶしいほど　かがやいていた！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:29:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カミツレ『ポケモンたちの
がんばりに　応えるため　そして▼
華やかな　スポットを
浴びて　もらいたくて……！▼
そういう意味で　あなたの　ポケモン
まぶしいほど　輝いていた！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:29:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER4
カミツレ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader5_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン『オマエさんが　ゆうしょう▼
それで　いいのかって？
もっと　つよいやつが　いるだろ？▼
そう　おもう　うでじまんは
ホドモエに　くるんだな！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:49:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン『オマエさんが　優勝▼
それで　いいのかって？
もっと　強い奴が　いるだろ？▼
そう　思う　腕自慢は
ホドモエに　来るんだな！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:49:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER5
ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:37" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader6_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『すごく　ちょうし　よくて
あいての　うごきが　みえて……▼
それでも　かてないのは
ポケモンは　おくが　ふかく▽
あなたは　すごいって　ことですよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:51:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『すごく　調子　よくて
相手の　動きが　みえて……▼
それでも　勝てないのは
ポケモンは　奥が　深く▽
あなたは　すごいって　ことですよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:51:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER6
フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader7_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『おいてなお！
しょうりを　ほっする！▼
それこそが　いきる　エネルギー！
きのうの　じぶんを　こえる　ちから！▼
きみの　しょうりを　たたえつつ
つぎこそは　かならず　かつ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:30:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シャガ『老いてなお！
勝利を　欲する！▼
それこそが　生きる　エネルギー！
昨日の　自分を　越える　力！▼
君の　勝利を　称えつつ
次こそは　必ず　勝つ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:30:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER7
シャガ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swleader8_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シズイ『あらぶる　うみのように
すべてを　ながしさったたい！▼
それが　いまの　おはんよ！
いやあ　すごかった！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:52:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>シズイ『荒ぶる　海のように
すべてを　流しさったたい！▼
それが　今の　おはんよ！
いやあ　すごかった！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:52:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_swbell_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベル『ポケモンの　ことを
ちょっとずつだけど　まなんで▼
みんなの　いいところを　だせるよう
かんがえているけど　まだまだね▼
あっ　わすれてた！
ゆうしょう　おめでとうね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:15:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベル『ポケモンの　ことを
ちょっとずつだけど　学んで▼
みんなの　いいところを　だせるよう
考えているけど　まだまだね▼
あっ　忘れてた！
優勝　おめでとうね！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:15:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:37:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_leader1a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポッド『ゆうしょう　か！
すごいな！▼
おれも　ゆうしょう　して
せかいいちの　ほのおつかい▽
ポッド！　って　なりたいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:55:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポッド『優勝　か！
すごいな！▼
おれも　優勝して
世界一の　炎使い▽
ポッド！　って　なりたいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T08:32:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>LEADER1A
ポッド</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
