		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_gsleader7_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤナギ『きみなら　これからも
ゆうしょうを　くりかえし▽
きっと　たいせつなものを　みつける▼
これからも　しょうじん　しなさい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T04:38:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤナギ『きみなら　これからも
優勝を　繰り返し▽
きっと　大切なものを　みつける▼
これからも　精進しなさい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:16:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GSLEADER7
ヤナギ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:39:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_gsleader8_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>イブキ『なによ
ゆうしょう　じまん　なの？▼
じゃあ　いってあげる▼
おめでとう！
とても　つよかったわ！▼
……これで　いい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:21:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イブキ『なによ
優勝　自慢なの？▼
じゃあ　いってあげる▼
おめでとう！
とても　強かったわ！▼
……これで　いい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:21:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GSLEADER8
イブキ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:39:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:31:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff78ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
