		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_dpleader2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ナタネ『すごいね！！▼
ねえねえ　どんな　きぶん？▼
あたしも　ゆうしょう　して
ポケモンを　じまん　したいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:25:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ナタネ『すごいね！！▼
ねえねえ　どんな　気分？▼
あたしも　優勝して
ポケモンを　自慢したいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:25:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・優勝後イベント用</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T08:57:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DPLEADER2
ナタネ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:40:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
