	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_sunglasses_info_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコン　か
ああみえて　どりょくの　ひとだな▼
ま　くわしいことは　ホドモエの
ポケモンジムに　いけば　わかる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:32:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコン　か
ああみえて　努力の　人だな▼
ま　詳しいことは　ホドモエの
ポケモンジムに　行けば　わかる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:47:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
