				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サカキ　ね……▼
いろんな　ウワサを　きくけれど
詳しいことは　存じません▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:09:30" />
