	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_sunglasses_info_28"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハヤト　か！▼
キキョウシティの　ジムリーダーで
ちちおやが　たよっていた　ポケモンと▽
ともに　たたかっている　わかものだ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:12:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハヤト　か！▼
キキョウシティの　ジムリーダーで
父親の　パートナーだった　ポケモンと▽
共に　戦っている　若者だ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:11:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・キャラ紹介
・msg_wbt_subev_sunglasses_02へ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:50:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SUNGLASSES</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:46:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-13T07:15:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#00ff00</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
