	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_subev_sunglasses_info_46"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒョウタ　ね▼
クロガネシティの
わかき　ジムリーダーだよ▼
まちの　たんこうで　はたらく
にんげんを　たばねてるってさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T09:49:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒョウタ　ね▼
クロガネシティの
若き　ジムリーダーだよ▼
街の　炭鉱で　働く
人間を　たばねてるってさ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-18T07:54:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-29T09:45:20" />
		</LanguageCell>
